<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<topic id="Untitled" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance"
    xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="urn:oasis:names:tc:dita:xsd:topic.xsd">
    <title>Gramless Analysis 1</title>
    <body>
        <p>Some background to this set of questions. Consider environmental factors and operational constraints when answering.</p>
        <p>
            <simpletable frame="all" relcolwidth="2.0* 0.5* 2.0*" outputclass="qd-quiz">
                <sthead>
                    <stentry>Question</stentry>
                    <stentry>Answer</stentry>
                    <stentry>Detail</stentry>
                </sthead>
                <strow>
                    <stentry>Have you considered depth effects on sound propagation?</stentry>
                    <stentry>1</stentry>
                    <stentry>
                        <ol>
                            <li>Yes, depth creates pressure gradients affecting speed of sound</li>
                            <li>No, depth has minimal impact</li>
                            <li>Only at extreme depths</li>
                            <li>Depth is irrelevant to sonar</li>
                        </ol>
                    </stentry>
                </strow>
                <strow>
                    <stentry>Have you considered height of the transducer array?</stentry>
                    <stentry>1</stentry>
                    <stentry>
                        <ol>
                            <li>Yes, transducer height affects beam geometry and coverage</li>
                            <li>No, height doesn't matter for sonar</li>
                            <li>Only for surface vessels</li>
                            <li>Height only matters for air operations</li>
                        </ol>
                    </stentry>
                </strow>
                <strow>
                    <stentry>Have you considered weather and sea state conditions?</stentry>
                    <stentry>1</stentry>
                    <stentry>
                        <ol>
                            <li>Yes, weather affects surface noise and propagation paths</li>
                            <li>No, weather doesn't affect underwater operations</li>
                            <li>Only during storms</li>
                            <li>Weather is only relevant for navigation</li>
                        </ol>
                    </stentry>
                </strow>
                <strow>
                    <stentry>What is the typical thermocline depth in these waters (in meters)?</stentry>
                    <stentry>50</stentry>
                    <stentry>15</stentry>
                </strow>
            </simpletable>
        </p>
    </body>
</topic>
